NOTE ON THE DATA FILES

The contents of the data/ directory are NOT the author's work and are not
covered by the license above. They are government public records, redistributed
here unmodified so that the tables in the paper are exactly reproducible:

  - data/2023-Autonomous-Vehicle-Disengagement-Reports-CSV.csv
    data/2024-Autonomous-Vehicle-Disengagement-Reports-CSV-1.csv
      California Department of Motor Vehicles, Autonomous Vehicle
      Disengagement Reports. California public records.
      https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/vehicle-industry-services/autonomous-vehicles/disengagement-reports/

  - data/SGO-2021-01_Incident_Reports_ADS.csv
      National Highway Traffic Safety Administration, Standing General Order
      2021-01 incident reporting. United States government work.
      https://www.nhtsa.gov/laws-regulations/standing-general-order-crash-reporting

Anyone redistributing these files should consult the issuing agency's own terms
rather than relying on this repository's license.
